This package is a native re-implementation of published standards and textbook
methods (see ORIGIN.json for the standards and their sections). It contains no
code from any other project and has no dependency on one.

The following projects were READ to understand which formulas a simulation toolkit
needs. Their algorithms are public knowledge; nothing of their code was copied:

  ommaganti/yield-curve-sim   MIT          (NSS fit, bump-and-reprice, key-rate tents)
  TommasoBelluzzo/BaselTools  Apache-2.0   (SA-CCR and SMA formula chain)
  mgao6767/brms               MIT          (rule-driven double-entry, for a later engine)

ORIGIN.json records, per project, what was taken as an idea and what was not taken.
